    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970416.0081\n\nROME, April 16 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nItalian factory prices up 0.8 percent in February\n\n\n\n\nItalian factory prices edged up 0.8 percent in February from 12 months earlier, the Italian statistics institute Istat said Wednesday.\n\nWholesale prises rose by only 0.5 percent from February 1996, confirming a downward trend in the country's inflation.",
